Why vendored: The RP2350 Pico SDK ships mbedTLS 3.6.2, which does not implement
ed25519 PSA keygen (PSA_WANT_ECC_TWISTED_EDWARDS_255 is DEPENDENCY_NOT_IMPLEMENTED_YET).
Monocypher provides a formally verified, ISC/BSD-2-Clause-licensed, self-contained
implementation suitable for Cortex-M embedded targets.

Version: master branch as of 2026-03-16.
Used for: DeviceIdentity Key (DIK) ed25519 keygen and signing (Stage 24).
